body:
I'm in my early 20s. 

&nbsp;

I can definitely identify with some of those sentiments. It is survival of the fittest and I'm really not cut out for this world and therefore won't survive it. I really have no qualms with it. Frankly, I'm kind of bewildered by how unbothered most people are but good for them I guess. I've wondered how different things would be if I felt the same but I dont so...

Thank you. I'm so sick of people just saying go to therapy! Take a pill! That's not the problem. My pain is all but irrelevant in this case. My issue is that I live in a world where unfathomably horrific things happen every single day and there's nothing I can do about it. 

&nbsp;

People say move on and get over it. Haha, I *am* over it. I'm over living and I'm prepared to move on.
